# Split second stops more than casting (CR 702.61a): while Bot1's Opt is on the stack, Bot2 may still activate a mana
# ability (CR 702.61b, Mox Ruby's {T}) but may not activate Fanatical Firebrand's "{T}, Sacrifice this creature: It deals
# 1 damage to any target" (the refusal). No damage is dealt and the Firebrand stays on the battlefield.

